    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Court of the Phoenician",
    "summary": "**EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** units of yours have **Sensational Performance**: each time the unit is picked to fight, if it made its **Charge move** earlier this turn, it may use this ability, and then for the rest of the phase:\n\n- It may not target any unit it began the turn within **Engagement Range** of.\n- It may not target a unit another unit has attacked this phase.\n- Its melee weapons improve their Strength and Armour Penetration by 1.",
